# Niramaya Backend Commands


## Run Backend Server

# Start backend server in development mode
npm run dev

# Start backend server in production mode
npm start


## Seed Yoga Data

# Seed Yoga data for development environment
npm run seed:yoga:dev

# Seed Yoga data for production environment
npm run seed:yoga


## Seed Ayurveda Data

# Seed Ayurveda data for development environment
npm run seed:ayurveda:dev

# Seed Ayurveda data for production environment
npm run seed:ayurveda


## Seed Admin Data

# Seed admin data for production environment
npm run seed:admin

# Seed admin data for development environment
npm run seed:admin:dev

